At 4 PM, I get off work.
I take the Metro home.
It is very cold outside.
So I hurry from the station to my apartment.
In the hallway, I meet my neighbour, Nina.
She smiles at me.
"Hi Maya, how is it going?" asks Nina.
"I am tired, but I am looking forward to a quiet evening," I reply.
Nina nods and opens her door.
"Have a good evening," she says.
"You too," I say.
I open my door and go inside into the warmth.
